{
    "title": "Smart Cast TV -Phone Projector",
    "description": "Fast screen-cast/screen mirror to TV experience: connect your phone to various Android TV devices, including roku devices. Smart Cast TV help you to watch phone files on TV: local videos, browse pictures, or listen to music.... we allows you to effortlessly enjoy all of these on the big screen.Fulfilling your desire for a big-screen experience has never been easier. \r\n\r\nFeature\uff1a\r\n\u2b55\ufe0fMirroring \uff1a \r\nYou can easily project the screen of your mobile device directly onto your TV, allowing for easy sharing and viewing. Whether you want to share photos with family and friends or present a multimedia presentation, Smart Cast TV makes it simple to showcase your content on the big screen.\r\n\r\n\u2b55\ufe0fCast\uff1a\r\nScreencast local video, picture, and audio files from phone to TV. You can easily cast your favorite HD movies, TV shows, music, and photos stored on your phone to your TV, creating an immersive audio-visual feast that brings entertainment to life.\r\n\r\nFurthermore, with Smart Cast TV, you can cast web videos to your TV, expanding your streaming options. Enjoy your favorite online content on the big screen, enhancing your viewing experience.\r\n\r\n\u2b55\ufe0fCompatible with Google Cast, allowing you to access the vast library of apps and content available for Google Cast. Discover new movies, TV shows, and more, and cast them effortlessly to your TV.\r\n\r\nSupported device types:\r\nMost large screen devices including.\r\n-Android TV / various Android smart boxes\r\n-Other TVs that support Google Cast and DLNA protocols\r\n-Roku devices;\r\nMobile: Android phones. \r\n\r\nHow to use\uff1a\r\nConnect your mobile phone and TV to the same WiFi network;\r\nOpen the phone software and connect the software to the TV;\r\nSimply choose the way you want to cast to the screen.\r\nIn short, Smart Cast TV gives you unparalleled screen casting fun . Download Smart Cast TV and start living your smart audio/visual life!\r\n\r\nExperience the convenience and versatility of Smart Cast TV\uff01Turn your TV into a movie projector, a photo gallery, and a music player\uff01 Enjoy the thrill of a big-screen experience from the comfort of your own home.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Fast screen-cast/screen mirror to TV experience: connect your phone to various Android TV devices, including roku devices. Smart Cast TV help you to watch phone files on TV: local videos, browse pictures, or listen to music.... we allows you to effortlessly enjoy all of these on the big screen.Fulfilling your desire for a big-screen experience has never been easier. <br><br>Feature\uff1a<br>\u2b55\ufe0fMirroring \uff1a <br>You can easily project the screen of your mobile device directly onto your TV, allowing for easy sharing and viewing. Whether you want to share photos with family and friends or present a multimedia presentation, Smart Cast TV makes it simple to showcase your content on the big screen.<br><br>\u2b55\ufe0fCast\uff1a<br>Screencast local video, picture, and audio files from phone to TV. You can easily cast your favorite HD movies, TV shows, music, and photos stored on your phone to your TV, creating an immersive audio-visual feast that brings entertainment to life.<br><br>Furthermore, with Smart Cast TV, you can cast web videos to your TV, expanding your streaming options. Enjoy your favorite online content on the big screen, enhancing your viewing experience.<br><br>\u2b55\ufe0fCompatible with Google Cast, allowing you to access the vast library of apps and content available for Google Cast. Discover new movies, TV shows, and more, and cast them effortlessly to your TV.<br><br>Supported device types:<br>Most large screen devices including.<br>-Android TV / various Android smart boxes<br>-Other TVs that support Google Cast and DLNA protocols<br>-Roku devices;<br>Mobile: Android phones. <br><br>How to use\uff1a<br>Connect your mobile phone and TV to the same WiFi network;<br>Open the phone software and connect the software to the TV;<br>Simply choose the way you want to cast to the screen.<br>In short, Smart Cast TV gives you unparalleled screen casting fun . Download Smart Cast TV and start living your smart audio/visual life!